                <pb facs="0915" n="801" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg801"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-05-06T15:00:00-05:45">May 6, 1931—3 p.m.</date><lb/>[Received
                        9:14 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>64. President Moncada has re-submitted the Honduras-Nicaraguan boundary protocol
                    (the documents of the original submission having <pb facs="0916" n="802"
                        xml:id="pg802"/> been destroyed in the recent fire) to the Nicaraguan
                    Congress and there is a chance that it will be approved in the few remaining
                    days of the session.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
